@url = https://localhost:7504
@accessToken = paste-rs256-access-token-here
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token-here

### OIDC Discovery Document & Public RSA JWKS
GET {{url}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

###
GET {{url}}/.well-known/jwks

### Register customer account (publishes transactional signed_up outbox event)
POST {{url}}/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Correct-horse-123!"
}

### Exchange OAuth 2.1 Authorization Code + PKCE (S256) for RS256 access/id/refresh tokens
POST {{url}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&client_id=davids-web&code=paste-authorization-code&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%2Fcallback&code_verifier=paste-pkce-code-verifier

### Rotate single-use refresh token
POST {{url}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&client_id=davids-web&refresh_token={{refreshToken}}

### OIDC UserInfo and /me
GET {{url}}/connect/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
GET {{url}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### RFC 7009 Token Revocation (revokes access token jti in SQL + Redis or refresh token grant)
POST {{url}}/connect/revocation
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=davids-web&token={{accessToken}}&token_type_hint=access_token
